1
00:01:51,111 --> 00:01:55,111
You, the Doctor, Tony Tony Chopper!

2
00:01:55,111 --> 00:01:57,111
Boil me or cook me alive!

3
00:01:57,111 --> 00:01:59,111
Give me your worst, you bastards!

4
00:02:01,111 --> 00:02:04,111
Now, an unlikely duo must win the second round,

5
00:02:04,111 --> 00:02:07,111
the Groggy Ring, to get Chopper back.

6
00:02:07,111 --> 00:02:10,111
Disappointed? Not at all.

7
00:02:12,111 --> 00:02:16,111
Round two, shoot it into the Groggy Ring!

8
00:02:16,111 --> 00:02:21,111
Chirp, chirp!

9
00:02:21,111 --> 00:02:24,111
Our mighty Groggy Ring combatants have taken the field!

10
00:02:24,111 --> 00:02:26,111
Opposing them on the Straw Hats team,

11
00:02:26,111 --> 00:02:29,111
their meddlesome sideline supporter from the first round,

12
00:02:29,111 --> 00:02:32,111
the Savage Chef, Sanjay!

13
00:02:32,111 --> 00:02:34,111
I think you mean Stylish Chef.

14
00:02:34,111 --> 00:02:38,111
And beside him, with a bounty of 60 million berries,

15
00:02:38,111 --> 00:02:41,111
Pirate Hunter, Ro-Ro-Noah Zorro!

16
00:02:41,111 --> 00:02:45,111
Hardly worth our time to squash a couple of pipsqueaks like these.

17
00:02:45,111 --> 00:02:48,111
Right, Big Pan?

18
00:02:52,111 --> 00:02:54,111
He can't hear you.

19
00:02:54,111 --> 00:02:55,111
Man, what do these guys eat?

20
00:02:55,111 --> 00:02:57,111
Well, start this out with a coin toss.

21
00:03:00,111 --> 00:03:01,111
Tails.

22
00:03:01,111 --> 00:03:02,111
What about you?

23
00:03:02,111 --> 00:03:04,111
Uh, kinda has to be heads, right?

24
00:03:06,111 --> 00:03:07,111
Tails!

25
00:03:10,111 --> 00:03:12,111
Field or ball?

26
00:03:12,111 --> 00:03:13,111
Ball, please.

27
00:03:13,111 --> 00:03:14,111
You heard him!

28
00:03:14,111 --> 00:03:17,111
Our Groggy Monsters have chosen them all!

29
00:03:17,111 --> 00:03:20,111
The Straw Hats Ball Man will now enter the other team's mid-circle.

30
00:03:20,111 --> 00:03:21,111
Left or right?

31
00:03:21,111 --> 00:03:22,111
Doesn't matter.

32
00:03:22,111 --> 00:03:23,111
In case you were wondering,

33
00:03:23,111 --> 00:03:26,111
the Ball Men are the players with the silly little hats on their heads!

34
00:03:26,111 --> 00:03:29,111
Knock your opponent's Ball Man into the ring on their side of the field,

35
00:03:29,111 --> 00:03:30,111
and the game is yours!

36
00:03:30,111 --> 00:03:32,111
Just get on with it!

37
00:03:33,111 --> 00:03:35,111
Hey, Ball Man, get in position already.

38
00:03:35,111 --> 00:03:38,111
Now listen, I never agreed to be the Ball in the first place.

39
00:03:38,111 --> 00:03:41,111
You better shut your mouth unless you want to boot to the teeth.

40
00:03:42,111 --> 00:03:45,111
How am I supposed to look cool with this thing on my head?

41
00:03:45,111 --> 00:03:46,111
You gonna cry over a hat?

42
00:03:47,111 --> 00:03:50,111
Hey, that looks good on you!

43
00:03:50,111 --> 00:03:52,111
You think I'm gonna fall for that stupid?!

44
00:03:52,111 --> 00:03:53,111
Zoro!

45
00:03:53,111 --> 00:03:54,111
Sanji!

46
00:03:54,111 --> 00:03:56,111
I'm counting on you!

47
00:03:56,111 --> 00:03:59,111
I'm sorry we lost the last round, you guys!

48
00:03:59,111 --> 00:04:00,111
It's up to you now!

49
00:04:00,111 --> 00:04:01,111
Please get Chopper back!

50
00:04:01,111 --> 00:04:02,111
You gotta!

51
00:04:02,111 --> 00:04:04,111
Wow, would you look at that?

52
00:04:04,111 --> 00:04:05,111
It's a real Wotan!

53
00:04:05,111 --> 00:04:09,111
They aren't as large as pure-blooded giants, but he's still pretty big.

54
00:04:12,111 --> 00:04:14,111
Don't bother cheering for your friends!

55
00:04:14,111 --> 00:04:15,111
It's no use!

56
00:04:15,111 --> 00:04:17,111
Those guys are more than just muscle!

57
00:04:17,111 --> 00:04:19,111
They're groggy ring experts!

58
00:04:19,111 --> 00:04:21,111
Oh, hey, split-head!

59
00:04:21,111 --> 00:04:22,111
Did you want something?

60
00:04:24,111 --> 00:04:25,111
He said it again!

61
00:04:27,111 --> 00:04:28,111
Poor boss!

62
00:04:29,111 --> 00:04:32,111
Why would you be so cruel to this sweet, gentle man?!

63
00:04:32,111 --> 00:04:35,111
What's with that face?

64
00:04:35,111 --> 00:04:37,111
If you're afraid I'm going to interfere again, then don't worry!

65
00:04:37,111 --> 00:04:41,111
I won't even need to in this round, you babies!

66
00:04:41,111 --> 00:04:43,111
Don't tell me you can butt in on this game, too!

67
00:04:43,111 --> 00:04:44,111
Yep!

68
00:04:44,111 --> 00:04:46,111
It all depends on how the captain feels!

69
00:04:46,111 --> 00:04:51,111
Naturally, some pilots like to fight fair and square so they can test the strength of their crew!

70
00:04:51,111 --> 00:04:54,111
Others will cheat any way they can to make sure they never lose a match!

71
00:04:54,111 --> 00:04:56,111
But I just do whatever I want!

72
00:04:56,111 --> 00:04:58,111
Fe-fe-fe-fe-fe-fe-fe-fe!

73
00:04:58,111 --> 00:05:01,111
I don't see why you're complaining about a little foul play here and there!

74
00:05:01,111 --> 00:05:05,111
If you're a real pirate, you should be used to these sorts of things!

75
00:05:05,111 --> 00:05:06,111
Right?

76
00:05:06,111 --> 00:05:07,111
The sea is treacherous!

77
00:05:07,111 --> 00:05:08,111
Oh, yeah!

78
00:05:08,111 --> 00:05:09,111
You would know!

79
00:05:09,111 --> 00:05:10,111
Three!

80
00:05:10,111 --> 00:05:13,111
By the way, your team looks to be playing a game of their own!

81
00:05:13,111 --> 00:05:14,111
Three!

82
00:05:14,111 --> 00:05:16,111
They do know the match is about to start, right?

83
00:05:16,111 --> 00:05:17,111
Three!

84
00:05:17,111 --> 00:05:18,111
Laugh while you still can!

85
00:05:18,111 --> 00:05:20,111
They're just laid back because they know they can win!

86
00:05:20,111 --> 00:05:21,111
I saw that, cheater!

87
00:05:21,111 --> 00:05:22,111
You went too early on that last one!

88
00:05:22,111 --> 00:05:23,111
Shut up!

89
00:05:23,111 --> 00:05:24,111
You're just mad because you lost!

90
00:05:24,111 --> 00:05:25,111
Like you always do!

91
00:05:25,111 --> 00:05:26,111
What?

92
00:05:26,111 --> 00:05:27,111
I always lose, huh?

93
00:05:27,111 --> 00:05:28,111
We'll just see about that!

94
00:05:28,111 --> 00:05:29,111
Let's do best three out of five!

95
00:05:29,111 --> 00:05:30,111
