100
00:05:34,111 --> 00:05:35,111
That hat looks great on you!

101
00:05:35,111 --> 00:05:36,111
All right!

102
00:05:36,111 --> 00:05:37,111
Let's rock!

103
00:05:37,111 --> 00:05:38,111
Ball man's here to kick some ass!

104
00:05:38,111 --> 00:05:39,111
Gotta admit it does suit you.

105
00:05:39,111 --> 00:05:40,111
You look like a real prince!

106
00:05:40,111 --> 00:05:50,111
From the kingdom of lame asses?

107
00:05:50,111 --> 00:05:51,111
Wasting time!

108
00:05:51,111 --> 00:05:52,111
Start the match!

109
00:05:52,111 --> 00:05:53,111
You suck!

110
00:05:53,111 --> 00:05:54,111
No, you suck!

111
00:05:54,111 --> 00:05:55,111
Hey, hold it!

112
00:05:55,111 --> 00:05:56,111
No weapons on the face!

113
00:05:56,111 --> 00:05:57,111
You suck!

114
00:05:57,111 --> 00:05:58,111
You suck!

115
00:05:58,111 --> 00:05:59,111
You suck!

116
00:05:59,111 --> 00:06:00,111
You suck!

117
00:06:00,111 --> 00:06:01,111
No, you suck!

118
00:06:01,111 --> 00:06:02,111
You suck!

119
00:06:02,111 --> 00:06:03,111
No weapons on the face!

120
00:06:03,111 --> 00:06:04,111
You suck!

121
00:06:04,111 --> 00:06:05,111
No!

122
00:06:05,111 --> 00:06:06,111
You suck!

123
00:06:06,111 --> 00:06:07,111
You suck!

124
00:06:07,111 --> 00:06:10,251
No weapons on the field, pal. You gotta lose the swords.

125
00:06:10,711 --> 00:06:11,971
Huh? Those the rules?

126
00:06:12,251 --> 00:06:14,511
Yeah, because this is a ball game.

127
00:06:15,131 --> 00:06:17,631
Can't have you slicing each other up, now can we?

128
00:06:19,731 --> 00:06:22,651
Fine. My fists are all I need.

129
00:06:23,131 --> 00:06:24,831
You sure you're going to be okay out there?

130
00:06:25,131 --> 00:06:27,851
A swordsman without his swords is just, well...

131
00:06:27,851 --> 00:06:28,271
What?

132
00:06:30,131 --> 00:06:32,551
A normal guy, only lamer.

133
00:06:37,111 --> 00:06:41,051
That wasn't even a good bird!

134
00:06:41,391 --> 00:06:42,851
Get over it!

135
00:06:42,911 --> 00:06:49,051
It certainly took long enough, but it looks like the Straw Hats ball man is finally making his way to the opponent's circle.

136
00:06:49,211 --> 00:06:51,231
Hey, Cook, hope you get trampled out there.

137
00:06:51,271 --> 00:06:51,911
Of yours.

138
00:06:54,051 --> 00:06:56,911
The crowd is hungry for action today!

139
00:06:57,431 --> 00:07:00,411
Big Pan, are you ready to make some grown men cry?

140
00:07:03,351 --> 00:07:03,791
Huh?

141
00:07:03,791 --> 00:07:06,591
P-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p-p.

142
00:07:06,591 --> 00:07:08,051
He can't hear you.

143
00:07:09,911 --> 00:07:12,971
Come on, man!

144
00:07:14,951 --> 00:07:16,451
Pay attention for once!

145
00:07:23,291 --> 00:07:25,371
It's not that funny! Stop laughing!

146
00:07:26,311 --> 00:07:29,971
What can I say? The groggy monsters are always up for a good laugh!

147
00:07:30,331 --> 00:07:30,811
Now!

148
00:07:30,811 --> 00:07:33,811
Now, why don't we go over a few quick rules?

149
00:07:33,811 --> 00:07:36,811
There's no time limit, and the first team to score wins!

150
00:07:37,811 --> 00:07:41,811
So all we gotta do to win this is knock Jumbo's head into the ring on their side.

151
00:07:41,811 --> 00:07:43,811
Simple enough.

152
00:07:47,811 --> 00:07:51,811
The hard part's gonna be stopping them from planting the cook's head in our ring.

153
00:07:51,811 --> 00:08:00,811
Can Team Straw Hat win back the reindeer they lost in round one, or will they lose another member?

154
00:08:00,811 --> 00:08:05,811
As you can see, Foxy's returning champs are laughing in the face of their competition.

155
00:08:05,811 --> 00:08:07,811
But will they be the ones to laugh last?

156
00:08:07,811 --> 00:08:10,811
The whistle is about to sound!

157
00:08:10,811 --> 00:08:21,811
Let the game begin!

158
00:08:21,811 --> 00:08:25,811
We start with Ball Man Sanji, deep in enemy territory.

159
00:08:25,811 --> 00:08:26,811
Will he retreat or attack?

160
00:08:26,811 --> 00:08:28,811
Let's do this!

161
00:08:28,811 --> 00:08:32,811
Tackle Machine Pickles takes off with a heavy charge!

162
00:08:32,811 --> 00:08:36,811
Okay, just gotta head for their Ball Man and finish him off.

163
00:08:36,811 --> 00:08:37,811
Sling Tackle!

164
00:08:37,811 --> 00:08:39,811
Get out of my way!

165
00:08:39,811 --> 00:08:41,811
Let's see what you got, Big Man!

166
00:08:41,811 --> 00:08:44,811
I hope that fat hat of yours fits in the goal!

167
00:08:44,811 --> 00:08:46,811
It's gonna be a Ball Man fight!

168
00:08:46,811 --> 00:08:47,811
Oh, yeah!

169
00:08:53,811 --> 00:08:55,811
Hey, what's going on here?

170
00:08:55,811 --> 00:08:56,811
Skin's all slimy!

171
00:08:56,811 --> 00:09:00,811
The chef is slipping and sliding on Big Pan's massive arm!

172
00:09:00,811 --> 00:09:03,811
But that's no surprise!

173
00:09:03,811 --> 00:09:06,811
After all, Big Pan's a loach-fished wootan!

174
00:09:06,811 --> 00:09:07,811
They have slippery skin!

175
00:09:07,811 --> 00:09:09,811
What the heck are you doing?

176
00:09:09,811 --> 00:09:10,811
Stop screwing around!

177
00:09:10,811 --> 00:09:11,811
Running gun!

178
00:09:11,811 --> 00:09:13,811
Get down here!

179
00:09:13,811 --> 00:09:15,811
You better watch what you wish for, sword man!

180
00:09:15,811 --> 00:09:20,811
Long pass!

181
00:09:20,811 --> 00:09:25,811
This is it!

182
00:09:25,811 --> 00:09:29,811
Big Pan Super Long Pass!

183
00:09:29,811 --> 00:09:30,811
Sling!

184
00:09:30,811 --> 00:09:38,811
Team Captain Hamburg races onto the scene for the catch!

185
00:09:38,811 --> 00:09:40,811
But Zoro is in hot pursuit as well!

186
00:09:40,811 --> 00:09:44,811
If that stupid head of yours makes it anywhere near the goal, I'm gonna chop it off!

187
00:09:44,811 --> 00:09:45,811
You talk big!

188
00:09:45,811 --> 00:09:47,811
But just wait till I get down there!

189
00:09:47,811 --> 00:09:49,811
Now my sweeping tackle!

190
00:09:49,811 --> 00:09:52,811
Pickles crosses over the rival team's line!

191
00:09:52,811 --> 00:09:56,811
Meanwhile, Hamburg flies high for a fancy mid-air catch!

192
00:09:56,811 --> 00:09:57,811
Perfect!

193
00:09:57,811 --> 00:09:58,811
And then...

194
00:09:58,811 --> 00:09:59,811
I got it!

195
00:09:59,811 --> 00:10:00,811
I got it!

196
00:10:00,811 --> 00:10:01,811
Pickles dashes into position!

197
00:10:01,811 --> 00:10:02,811
Get back here, dammit!

198
00:10:02,811 --> 00:10:03,811
Toro goes for an interception!

199
00:10:03,811 --> 00:10:04,811
Spending tackle!

200
00:10:04,811 --> 00:10:05,811
Uh-oh!

201
00:10:05,811 --> 00:10:09,811
With his partner down, Ballman Satchi isn't spiraling into the sky!

202
00:10:09,811 --> 00:10:10,811
Satchi!

203
00:10:10,811 --> 00:10:15,811
Bringing up the rear, Big Pan storms across the field and catches the falling ram bird!

204
00:10:15,811 --> 00:10:16,811
Pongrously!

205
00:10:16,811 --> 00:10:20,811
Once again, Hamburg nabs Satchi with a perfect catch!

206
00:10:20,811 --> 00:10:21,811
Incredible!

207
00:10:21,811 --> 00:10:22,811
The ring is inside!

208
00:10:22,811 --> 00:10:23,811
