Oh!

231
00:10:45,811 --> 00:10:46,811
There you go!

232
00:10:46,811 --> 00:10:47,811
Yeah!

233
00:10:47,811 --> 00:10:48,811
It's the Hamburger Dove!

234
00:10:48,811 --> 00:10:53,811
Come about!

235
00:10:53,811 --> 00:10:54,811
Hurry!

236
00:10:54,811 --> 00:10:55,811
Do something!

237
00:10:55,811 --> 00:10:56,811
Toro!

238
00:10:56,811 --> 00:10:57,811
Satchi!

239
00:10:57,811 --> 00:10:59,811
