245
00:11:10,811 --> 00:11:15,811
All right, you've had your fun.

246
00:11:21,051 --> 00:11:23,591
Time to put me down, fathead.

247
00:11:23,591 --> 00:11:27,211
I can't let Zoro bail me out of this.

248
00:11:27,211 --> 00:11:29,431
