No goal!

252
00:11:57,431 --> 00:11:59,431
Balmintachi is back on the ground

253
00:11:59,431 --> 00:12:02,431
and looks like he's ready for some more action.

254
00:12:02,431 --> 00:12:09,431
I can take care of myself just fine.

255
00:12:09,431 --> 00:12:10,431
