256
00:12:10,431 --> 00:12:12,431
If you could stay on the ground, ball.

257
00:12:12,431 --> 00:12:14,431
It seems our groggy monsters

258
00:12:14,431 --> 00:12:17,431
have finally found some worthy adversaries in the ring.

259
00:12:17,431 --> 00:12:19,431
This one will be a match to remember.

260
